      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page_number": 2,
      "text": "(d) The failure by a party; without reasonable excuse; to comply with RDC 38.33 to RDC 38.36 will be taken into account by the Court in deciding what order to make about the costs of the claim; hearing or application; and about the costs of any further hearing or detailed assessment hearing",
